id: tail
name: Tail
order: 19
description: >
  Born with a long, maneuverable tail, you can use this tail as an extra hand, or in some cases, as a weapon.
text: >
  Tail: Born with a long, maneuverable tail, you can use this tail as an extra hand, or in some cases, as a weapon.
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Tail Attack Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers).
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Strike Roll of your Tail Attack Maneuver by 1(T).

---

[passive]
# (1)
allow maneuver.tail-attack;
# (2) A row on its Strike as it is declared (chat.mjs postAttack).
allow tailBeast.strike;
